# --- bakery network-build regenerated outputs (examples/*_network/large/) ---
# build_hybrid_gromacs() writes hyb_conf.gro/missing_definitions.txt/etc.
# directly into the source dir on every run, including numbered backups on
# repeat runs. hyb_topol.top is vendored (Task 1) and must stay committed;
# everything else here is regenerable output, never source.
examples/melamine_network/large/hyb_conf.gro
examples/melamine_network/large/at_hyb_topol.top
examples/melamine_network/large/cross_*_hyb_topol.dat
examples/melamine_network/large/exclusion_hyb_topol.list
examples/melamine_network/large/graph_before_cross_bonds.pck
examples/melamine_network/large/missing_definitions.txt
examples/melamine_network/large/_*_*
